  "text_md": "    <td>Scenario 2<br><br>Mark is traveling by train and he decides to view a live F1 race on his 3G wireless computer. He logs in the Melisa service and chooses to watch the televised race watching the normal video feed of the broadcaster.<br><br>He clicks on the classification button and the Drivers Classification Panel displays the current drivers positions. Mark chooses the graphical representation mode. In this mode the exact position of all cars, is shown as a graphical representation on a Virtual Track in real time. Visual cues, such as color and car number, show the relative position of the drivers in the track.<br><br>Mark clicks on his favourite driver’s car to display the available statistical information. He sees the drivers sponsor and he decides to click on the Sponsor’s logo to receive further information. This action redirects him the to sponsors e-commerce Web Site for on-line shopping.<br><br>![](<0d7383fad5205f1faaacd0713f4f08509af5_page_5_pg1_images/imageFile7.png>)<br><br>![](<0d7383fad5205f1faaacd0713f4f08509af5_page_5_pg1_images/imageFile8.png>)<br><br>![](<0d7383fad5205f1faaacd0713f4f08509af5_page_5_pg1_images/imageFile9.png>)<br><br>![](<0d7383fad5205f1faaacd0713f4f08509af5_page_5_pg1_images/imageFile10.png>)<br><br>![](<0d7383fad5205f1faaacd0713f4f08509af5_page_5_pg1_images/imageFile11.png>)</td>\n- • The Interactivity and the Visualisation of complementary information offers an enhanced sports viewing experience.\n<table>\n- • Increase the subscription base by offering new added value enhanced services to the subscribers with the provision of an innovative low-cost technology.\nBroadcaster Additional revenue streams for the sports\n  </tr>\nSubscriber\n  </tr>\n- • Profile based filtering offering the viewer control over the received information.\n![](<0d7383fad5205f1faaacd0713f4f08509af5_page_5_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n- • Advanced On-line Betting environment for an enhanced betting experience.",
